{
  "an7.42:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 7.42 ",
  "an7.42:0.2": "4. Devatāvagga ",
  "an7.42:0.3": "Paṭhamaniddasasutta ",
  "an7.42:1.1": "Atha kho āyasmā sāriputto pubbaṇhasamayaṁ nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya sāvatthiṁ piṇḍāya pāvisi. ",
  "an7.42:1.2": "Atha kho āyasmato sāriputtassa etadahosi: ",
  "an7.42:1.3": "“atippago kho tāva sāvatthiyaṁ piṇḍāya carituṁ. ",
  "an7.42:1.4": "Yannūnāhaṁ yena aññatitthiyānaṁ paribbājakānaṁ ārāmo tenupasaṅkameyyan”ti. ",
  "an7.42:1.5": "Atha kho āyasmā sāriputto yena aññatitthiyānaṁ paribbājakānaṁ ārāmo tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā tehi aññatitthiyehi paribbājakehi saddhiṁ sammodi. ",
  "an7.42:1.6": "Sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. ",
  "an7.42:1.7": "Tena kho pana samayena tesaṁ aññatitthiyānaṁ paribbājakānaṁ sannisinnānaṁ sannipatitānaṁ ayamantarākathā udapādi: ",
  "an7.42:1.8": "“yo hi koci, āvuso, dvādasavassāni paripuṇṇaṁ parisuddhaṁ brahmacariyaṁ carati, ‘niddaso bhikkhū’ti alaṁvacanāyā”ti. ",
  "an7.42:2.1": "Atha kho āyasmā sāriputto tesaṁ aññatitthiyānaṁ paribbājakānaṁ bhāsitaṁ neva abhinandi nappaṭikkosi. ",
  "an7.42:2.2": "Anabhinanditvā appaṭikkositvā uṭṭhāyāsanā pakkāmi: ",
  "an7.42:2.3": "“bhagavato santike etassa bhāsitassa atthaṁ ājānissāmī”ti. ",
  "an7.42:2.4": "Atha kho āyasmā sāriputto sāvatthiyaṁ piṇḍāya caritvā pacchābhatta